{"id":"anerkennung","lemma":"Anerkennung","pos":"noun","rank":3854,"glosses":["appreciation (a just valuation or estimate of merit, worth, weight, etc.; recognition of excellence)","recognition"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9b/De-Anerkennung.ogg/De-Anerkennung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Anerkennung","plural":"Anerkennungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Seine Tapferkeit verdient Anerkennung.","en":"His bravery is worth respecting.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"bravery"},{"g":"deserved"},null]},{"text":"Tom hat Anerkennung verdient.","en":"Tom deserves recognition.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"deserved"}]},{"text":"Kinder sehnen sich nach Anerkennung von ihren Eltern.","en":"Children seek approval from their parents.","words":[{"g":"kid","l":"Kind"},{"g":"sinew","l":"Sehne"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"after / to"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},{"g":"parents"}]},{"text":"Ich will keine Bewunderung, sondern lediglich Anerkennung.","en":"I don't want admiration, just recognition.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"admiration"},{"g":"to separate, to sunder"},{"g":"merely"},null]},{"text":"Tom gebührt die ganze Anerkennung.","en":"Tom deserves all the credit.","words":[null,{"g":"to be due","l":"gebühren"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"entire","l":"ganz"},null]}]}